  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "棒状のパンを　スライスしたもの。小麦の香りと　素朴な塩味はどんな食材とも　マッチするのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "막대기 모양의 빵을 자른 것. 밀가루의 향과 소박한 짠맛이 어떤 식재료와도 잘 어울린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "切開的棒狀麵包。小麥的香氣和樸素的鹹味和什麼樣的食材都能搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un pain oblong coupé en deux. Son parfum de blé et son goût naturellement salé lui permettent d’aller avec toutes sortes d’ingrédients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Die länglichen Brothälften harmonieren dank ihres wunderbaren Weizendufts sowie ihres schlichten salzigen Geschmacks mit allen möglichen Zutaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una barra de pan cortada en dos mitades. El aroma suave del trigo y su sencillo sabor salado casan a la perfección con cualquier ingrediente.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Filoncino di pane tagliato a metà. L’aroma del grano e il sapore semplice del sale lo rendono perfetto per ogni tipo di companatico.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A long loaf sliced into top and bottom halves. Its aroma of wheat and its straightforward, salty flavor make it pair well with all kinds of sandwich ingredients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "棒状のパンを　スライスしたもの。小麦の香りと　素朴な塩味はどんな食材とも　マッチするのだ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以切开的棒状面包制成。带有小麦的香味与朴素的咸味，无论与什么食材都很搭配。",
